{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Arithmetic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Arithmetic)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Algebra)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Algebra)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀1_min_solution_🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀1 min solution 🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_ParkerJ33\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by ParkerJ33</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four numbers are written in a row. The average of the first two is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef9ca64d92c34ac479e415fd7a4a0bf81d19028.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> the average of the middle two is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5ff27177e75a28a0de33399f94baec8cd2df2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> and the average of the last two is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/a/f2a8c6bab62d0931b9d43a9658b409b14b8d7c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> What is the average of the first and last of the numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/529c24849cb0739c0db8fa9c01deff692357eb9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 24 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 25 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 26 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 27 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Arithmetic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Arithmetic)\">Solution 1 (Arithmetic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Arithmetic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the sum of the first two numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4a9c81d611e18bcd72c9c95e0c9930f56d9945e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21\\cdot2=42,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" /> the sum of the middle two numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8a5e91bb8c28b74d36b7f1de435b26b94014afd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26\\cdot2=52,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" /> and the sum of the last two numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d840091ba8667c741680dfa7c2e67b7b0a413251.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\cdot2=60.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>It follows that the sum of the four numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e6367fbc7828118c73e20404547701dc4d5a89e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42+60=102,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"17\" /> so the sum of the first and last numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/d/64db0033971a669ea94baaa6eeec3c2b93bb7b27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$102-52=50.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" /> Therefore, the average of the first and last numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3a3b7fadad152b1f83e677383d1db451f0a74cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\div2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 25}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"145\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Algebra.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Algebra)\">Solution 2 (Algebra)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Algebra)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b8490a47ba3063da2731316f5d65dc5cf731ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the four numbers in that order. We are given that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d151877011aefd0d0e59b04bf73437cf57fba64.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{a+b}{2} &amp;= 21, &amp;(1) \\\\ \\frac{b+c}{2} &amp;= 26, &amp;(2) \\\\ \\frac{c+d}{2} &amp;= 30, &amp;(3) \\end{align*}\" width=\"232\" height=\"125\" />\nand we wish to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19a555bbec6a9a6cf745cb9704d7ebbd1e654dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+d}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>We add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/9011d0e0615c63ca8738fe88e08dc53b52d22751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> then subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> from the result: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbfec2d8a8f3b506dc010c0fae39d1777f6b929d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+d}{2}=21+30-26=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 25}.\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"37\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b8490a47ba3063da2731316f5d65dc5cf731ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the four numbers in that order. We are given that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d151877011aefd0d0e59b04bf73437cf57fba64.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{a+b}{2} &amp;= 21, &amp;(1) \\\\ \\frac{b+c}{2} &amp;= 26, &amp;(2) \\\\ \\frac{c+d}{2} &amp;= 30, &amp;(3) \\end{align*}\" width=\"232\" height=\"125\" />\nand we wish to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19a555bbec6a9a6cf745cb9704d7ebbd1e654dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+d}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>If we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0ddfc1e9680c4ce9e0d83871b20a14a831cce52a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{c+d}{2}-\\frac{b+c}{2}=\\frac{d-b}{2}=4.\\]\" width=\"210\" height=\"37\" />\nSo if we multiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> then we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/0/360252e51073a0e56de7c1693af2b29a0e3e953f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=b+8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" /> Looking at our question: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/91976e9fe7a4dd1778db55f3f962c1b953ab3301.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+d}{2}=\\frac{a+b+8}{2}=\\frac{a+b}{2}+\\frac{8}{2}=21+4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 25}.\\]\" width=\"411\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>~funnyarmadillo58_aops\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let’s label these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\nWe can use elimination to solve this: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d7701e9469f26e22c106341791344b28f3196443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>and since \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\nFinally, to find the average, divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>-OddPeppyBoots\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=1930\">https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=1930</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=2goytlOr7qxq69I9&amp;t=2801\">https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=2goytlOr7qxq69I9&amp;t=2801</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.801_min_solution_.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀1_min_solution_🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀1 min solution 🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀1 min solution 🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oVG6zqPVPfM\">https://youtu.be/oVG6zqPVPfM</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ij9pAy6tQSg?t=1394\">https://youtu.be/Ij9pAy6tQSg?t=1394</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_ParkerJ33\">Video Solution by ParkerJ33</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by ParkerJ33\">edit</a><span class=\"